OL,3,GNEWSAVote counting under way in the
OL,4,AHolborn and St Pancras by-election
OL,5,
OL,6,FBallots are being counted in the
OL,7,FHolborn and St Pancras by-election,
OL,8,Fwith the result expected to be declared
OL,9,Fin the early hours of Friday
OL,11,FParty members are huddled on each
OL,12,Fcounting floor making predictions of
OL,13,Fhow well their candidates have done,
OL,14,Fwrites our reporter at the count
OL,16,FThe turnout in Thursday's vote is
OL,17,Fconfirmed as 38.76%, which is lower
OL,18,Fthan the 2024 General Election
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
