OL,3,GNEWSAVote counting under way in the
OL,4,AHolborn and St Pancras by-election
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe north London seat became vacant
OL,7,Fafter former Prime Minister Keir
OL,8,FStarmer announced he was standing down
OL,9,Ffrom the House of Commons last month
OL,11,FThis by-election is a test of whether
OL,12,Fthe Labour Party under Burnham's
OL,13,Fleadership can beat the Green Party on
OL,14,Fits left, writes our correspondent -
OL,15,Fhere's a reminder of who is running for
OL,16,FLabour and the Greens
OL,18,FHolborn and St Pancras is a
OL,19,Fconstituency full of well-known London
OL,20,Flandmarks, and just under half of
OL,21,Fresidents are aged under-30 - these are
OL,22,Fthe areas covered by the consituency
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
